000001        *================================================================*
000002        * PROGRAMA : FATRESUM                                            *
000003        * AULA     : ENTREGA DESAFIO 10                                  *
000004        *================================================================*
000005         IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000006         PROGRAM-ID. FATRESUM.
000007
000008         ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000009         CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000010         SPECIAL-NAMES.
000011             DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
000012         INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000013         FILE-CONTROL.
000014             SELECT ARQ-DIVERG  ASSIGN TO DIVIN *> vou chamar o ARQ-DIVERG
000015                    FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-ENTRADA.
000016
000017         DATA DIVISION.
000018         FILE SECTION.
000019         FD  ARQ-DIVERG *> oq esta a seguir dita as regras do resto
000020             RECORDING MODE IS F. *> seta que é fixo
000021             COPY CPDIVER.
000001C       *================================================================*
000002C       * CPDIVER  - DIVERGENCIA DA CONCILIACAO DE PAGAMENTOS            *
000003C       * LRECL 80, RECFM FB.                                            *
000004C       *================================================================*
000005C        01  REG-DIVERGENCIA.
000006C            05  DV-NUM-CARTAO-MASC     PIC X(16).
000007C            05  DV-TIPO                PIC X(02).
000008C                88  DV-PAGTO-SEM-FATURA          VALUE 'PS'.
000009C                88  DV-FATURA-SEM-PAGTO          VALUE 'FS'.
000010C                88  DV-PAGTO-A-MENOR             VALUE 'PM'.
000011C            05  DV-VALOR-FATURA        PIC 9(09)V99.
000012C            05  DV-VALOR-PAGO          PIC 9(09)V99.
000013C            05  FILLER                 PIC X(40).
000022
000023         WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000024         01 WS-FS-ENTRADA                  PIC XX.
000025             88  WS-FS-ENTRADA-OK          VALUE '00'.
000026             88  WS-FS-ENTRADA-FIM         VALUE '10'.
000027         *> acima recebe o filestatus
000028
000029         01 WS-CONTADORES-QTD.
000030               05 WS-QTD-LIDOS        PIC 9(05) VALUE ZEROS.
000031               05 WS-QTD-PS           PIC 9(05) VALUE ZEROS.
000032               05 WS-QTD-FS           PIC 9(05) VALUE ZEROS.
000033               05 WS-QTD-PM           PIC 9(05) VALUE ZEROS.
000034
000035         01  WS-ACUMULADORES-VALORES.
000036             05  WS-FATURA-PS         PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
000037             05  WS-PAGO-PS           PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
000038             05  WS-FATURA-FS         PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
000039             05  WS-PAGO-FS           PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
