000050         PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000051
000052         0000-PRINCIPAL.
000053             PERFORM 1000-INICIALIZAR
000054                THRU 1000-FIM-INICIALIZAR
000055
000056             PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR
000057                THRU 2000-FIM-PROCESSAR
