000059
000060             PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR
000061                THRU 3000-FIM-FINALIZAR
000062
000063             STOP RUN
000064             .
000065
000066         1000-INICIALIZAR.
000067             OPEN INPUT ARQ-DIVERG
000068
000069             *> testar o File Status do OPEN
000070             IF NOT WS-FS-ENTRADA-OK
